# Local coding model for aider (see .github or CLAUDE notes).
#
# Devstral Small 2 (24B, Mistral, Apache 2.0) - agentic coding model tuned for
# tool use and multi-file edits. Replaced qwen3-coder:30b as the default after a
# bake-off on 2026-08-09: devstral was the only model that consistently handled
# a task requiring it to read a real 20-field data class and write both the
# utility and its tests (qwen3-coder never finished a two-file task at all).
#
# 15 GB at Q4_K_M against ~14.2 GB of free VRAM on the 16 GB laptop 4090, so a
# small CPU spill remains - still less than the 18 GB qwen3-coder needed.
#
#   ollama create devstral-8k -f Modelfile.devstral

FROM devstral-small-2:24b
PARAMETER num_ctx 8192
